OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 1,600 sign petition to
OL,4,Asave leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,600 people have signed a
OL,7,Fpetition opposing plans to close a
OL,8,Fleisure centre in Leicester.
OL,10,FThe petition, launched in response to
OL,11,Fproposals to shut New Parks Leisure
OL,12,FCentre, has attracted growing support
OL,13,Ffrom residents and users of the
OL,14,Ffacility.
OL,16,FLeicester City Council is consulting on
OL,17,Fplans that could see the centre in St
OL,18,FOswald's Road close, while facilities
OL,19,Fat Leicester Leys Leisure Centre in
OL,20,FBeaumont Leys are expanded.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
