OL,3,GNEWSAMore than 1,600 sign petition to
OL,4,Asave leisure centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the proposals were
OL,7,Fbeing considered because New Parks is
OL,8,Fits least-used leisure centre and has a
OL,9,Fhigher cost per visitor than its other
OL,10,Ffacilities.
